# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the irblasterd harness.
#
# glib's GAsyncQueue keeps its entries in GList nodes it allocates when a job
# is pushed (main thread) and frees with g_slice_free1 when the job is popped
# (worker), under a futex lock TSan cannot see. The node is glib's own and
# irblasterd never calls g_slice_*, so this matches nothing of ours. Our own
# hand-overs are annotated in test.c instead of suppressed.
race:g_slice_free1
# The same node freed on the GQueue path - also hit with no job ever pushed,
# by the stop message g_thread_pool_free() queues for its own worker.
race:g_queue_pop_tail
